  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nGiven that, \n\ny = k(x + 3) ----(1)\n\nWhen x = 1 ⇒ y = 8\n\n⇒ 8 = k(1 + 3)\n\n⇒ 8 = 4k\n\n⇒** k = 2**\n\nWhen z = 6 ⇒ x = 2\n\n⇒ x = k'/z ----(2)\n\n⇒ 2 = k'/6\n\n⇒ **k' = 12**\n\nFrom equation (1) & (2)\n\n⇒ y = k[(k'/z) + 3]\n\n⇒ y = 2[(12/z) + 3]\n\n⇒ y = 24/z + 6\n\n⇒ y - 6 = 24/z\n\n⇒ z(y - 6) = 24\n\n**∴ Correct answer is z(y - 6) = 24**",
